# mnvoice custom vocabulary / keyterm hints
# Copy to keywords.txt next to mnvoice.exe and add your own words.
#
# These words bias the speech model toward recognizing them correctly.
# Use this for technical jargon, project names, acronyms, or names the
# model tends to mishear. One word per line, or comma-separated.
# Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# This file is intentionally empty - your keywords.txt is personal and is
# gitignored so it never gets committed with the project.
#
# Example entries:
# Kubernetes
# PostgreSQL
# TypeScript, PyInstaller
